{"id":"b5b64991d8dc3e7d","group":"20","path":"20/20-df-effective-immune.md","title":"有效免疫集合","display":"df-effective-immune — 有效免疫集合","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-df-effective-immune","aliases":["20-df-effective-immune"],"display":"df-effective-immune — 有效免疫集合","chapter":"5","section":"5.4.3","source_kind":"book-with-local-formalization","verification_status":"definition-checked","source_reference":"Exercise 5.4.6；与 Definition 5.2.4 对照","source_printed_pages":[110,119],"source_pdf_pages":[145,154],"depends_on":["[[20-df-immune]]","[[20-df-effective-simple]]","[[20-df-computable]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-df-effective-immune"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-df-effective-immune</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-effective-immune — 有效免疫集合"},{"key":"chapter","html":"5"},{"key":"section","html":"5.4.3"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book-with-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"definition-checked"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Exercise 5.4.6；与 Definition 5.2.4 对照"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>110</span><span>119</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>145</span><span>154</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"991aaed4a87c5835\" href=\"?note=991aaed4a87c5835\" title=\"20-df-immune\">20-df-immune</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"3ec173dab9734388\" href=\"?note=3ec173dab9734388\" title=\"20-df-effective-simple\">20-df-effective-simple</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e343870c773cb68e\" href=\"?note=e343870c773cb68e\" title=\"20-df-computable\">20-df-computable</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\\subseteq\\omega\">\\(B\\subseteq\\omega\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W_e\">\\(W_e\\)</span> 为标准 c.e. 编号，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C_1^{\\mathrm{tot}}\">\\(\\mathcal C_1^{\\mathrm{tot}}\\)</span> 为全可计算一元函数族。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"991aaed4a87c5835\" href=\"?note=991aaed4a87c5835\" title=\"20-df-immune\">20-df-immune</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"3ec173dab9734388\" href=\"?note=3ec173dab9734388\" title=\"20-df-effective-simple\">20-df-effective-simple</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"e343870c773cb68e\" href=\"?note=e343870c773cb68e\" title=\"20-df-computable\">20-df-computable</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}effective-immune}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{EffectivelyImmune}(B):\\Longleftrightarrow\n|B|=\\omega\\land\\exists b\\in\\mathcal C_1^{\\mathrm{tot}}\\ \\forall e\\\n[W_e\\subseteq B\\Rightarrow |W_e|\\le b(e)].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}effective-immune}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{EffectivelyImmune}(B):\\Longleftrightarrow\n|B|=\\omega\\land\\exists b\\in\\mathcal C_1^{\\mathrm{tot}}\\ \\forall e\\\n[W_e\\subseteq B\\Rightarrow |W_e|\\le b(e)].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>这是无限集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span> 内 c.e. 子集的统一有效基数界，不要求 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span> 自身 c.e.。原书习题用严格界 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|W_e|&lt;f(e)\">\\(|W_e|&lt;f(e)\\)</span>：从本式取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f=b+1\">\\(f=b+1\\)</span>，反向从严格界取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b=f\">\\(b=f\\)</span> 即可，两个存在性定义等价。任何无限 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\subseteq B\">\\(S\\subseteq B\\)</span> 继承同一非严格界，因为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W_e\\subseteq S\">\\(W_e\\subseteq S\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W_e\\subseteq B\">\\(W_e\\subseteq B\\)</span>。该界蕴含普通免疫性。</p>\n<p>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> c.e. 且补集有效免疫，补集无限及该界已蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 简单，从而 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 有效简单；反向也成立。把概念单列，是为了在第九章对可能非 c.e. 的无限路径子集使用它，不能直接给这种子集加上 EffectivelySimple。</p>\n<p>来源：印刷 119 / PDF 154；定义间关系亦参印刷 110 / PDF 145。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-immune","status":"resolved","id":"991aaed4a87c5835","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-immune]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-effective-simple","status":"resolved","id":"3ec173dab9734388","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-effective-simple]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"e343870c773cb68e","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-computable]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-immune","status":"resolved","id":"991aaed4a87c5835","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-immune]]；see [[20-df-effective-simple]]；see [[20-df-computable]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-effective-simple","status":"resolved","id":"3ec173dab9734388","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-immune]]；see [[20-df-effective-simple]]；see [[20-df-computable]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"e343870c773cb68e","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-immune]]；see [[20-df-effective-simple]]；see [[20-df-computable]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"B\\subseteq\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"W_e","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal C_1^{\\mathrm{tot}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}effective-immune}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{EffectivelyImmune}(B):\\Longleftrightarrow\n|B|=\\omega\\land\\exists b\\in\\mathcal C_1^{\\mathrm{tot}}\\ \\forall e\\\n[W_e\\subseteq B\\Rightarrow |W_e|\\le b(e)].","display":true},{"tex":"B","display":false},{"tex":"B","display":false},{"tex":"|W_e|<f(e)","display":false},{"tex":"f=b+1","display":false},{"tex":"b=f","display":false},{"tex":"S\\subseteq B","display":false},{"tex":"W_e\\subseteq S","display":false},{"tex":"W_e\\subseteq B","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false}],"bytes":1783,"backlinks":[{"id":"5fb6eea724c1b5f2","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-effective-immune]]；see [[20-df-finite-code]]；see [[20-df-re]]；see [[20-df-K]]；see [[20-thm-ce-oracle-approximation-modulus]]；see [[20-thm-recursion-parameters]]；see [[20-thm-K-one-complete]]。"},{"id":"cc21d215609a3083","anchor":"ref-16","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-closed-class]]；see [[20-df-basis]]；see [[20-df-re]]；see [[20-df-K]]；see [[20-thm-simple-exists]]；see [[20-df-effective-immune]]；see [[20-thm-hyperimmune-bound]]；see [[20-df-finite-array]]；see [[20-thm-closed-class-tree-equivalence]]；see [[20-thm-effective-immune-ce-upper]]。"},{"id":"005203b6707a19f4","anchor":"ref-115","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-df-effective-immune]] — 章 5；直接提供者 3 个。"},{"id":"f4368dd1e05cad1f","anchor":"ref-115","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"ex